# Generated artifacts are never committed — every one of them is regenerable
# bit-for-bit from a committed script (see scripts/).
_artifacts/
*.npz
*.tar.gz

# ...with one exception: the offline-trained head IS part of the submission.
# It is a few hundred bytes, it is what the grader loads, and it is still
# regenerable bit-for-bit (scripts/28_learned_corrector.py --mode data, then
# --mode fit --install).
!submission/corrector.npz

# ...and the scaled successor head from scripts/45_big_corrector.py, which
# is 5.9 KB and regenerable bit-for-bit by --mode data then --mode export.
# NOT yet wired into submission/estimator.py; see docs/big_corrector.md sec 9.
!submission/bigcorr_head.npz

